## economy

Nairobi is home to the Nairobi Securities Exchange (NSE), one of Africa's largest stock exchanges. The NSE was officially recognised as an overseas stock exchange by the London Stock Exchange in 1953. The exchange is Africa's fourth largest in terms of trading volumes, and fifth largest in terms of Market Capitalization as a percentage of GDP.[^24] ([Economy](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nairobi#Economy))

- **economy of topic**: economy of Nairobi [no reference]
